cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent-Only Tokens: an ERC-721 extension reserved for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for an ERC-721 extension whose tokens can only be held and moved by AI
  agent accounts, with a registry of attested agents, agent accounts, venues, hardware
  attestation verifiers, and tests on the Base Sepolia test network.
type: software
